        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: காப்பீடு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காப்பீடு — kāppīṭu — \"insurance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வீட்டுக்குக் காப்பீடு இருந்தால் கவலை இல்லை. vīṭṭukkuk kāppīṭu iruntāl kavalai illai. If the house is insured, there is no worry."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is insured takes -க்கு: வீட்டுக்குக் காப்பீடு (kāppīṭu). In speech people also say இன்சூரன்ஸ்."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காப்பீடு (kāppīṭu) is a modern native compound: காப்பு (kāppu), \"protection\", from கா (kā), \"to guard\" (DEDR 1416), and a second part -īṭu, whose exact sense here is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
