              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இந்த முதலீட்டில் இடர் அதிகம். inta mutalīṭṭil iṭar atikam. There is a lot of risk in this investment."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A literary word; in insurance it means the risk covered."
            }
          ]
