          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of முகவர் (mukavar) is not settled: it looks built on முகம் (mukam), \"the face, the front\" (DEDR 4889), with a personal ending, but no dictionary we can check shows the formation."
